# Files `vercel deploy` must not upload: secrets, local build output and data.
# Vercel installs dependencies and builds each service itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
apps/api/uploads
docs
# Coding-agent tooling (added by `vercel integration add`), not part of the app.
.agents
.claude
skills-lock.json
